  "label": "Racist Stereotype: 'Sea Monkeys'",
  "description": "The term 'sea monkeys' is used in the meme as a derogatory racial stereotype to equate Black people with primates. This is a well-documented form of anti-Black racism that dehumanizes Black individuals by invoking a harmful, degrading metaphor rooted in historical racial prejudice. The term itself is not visible in the image but is central to understanding the hateful intent of the meme.",
